l and flowing, crafted from smooth satin or velvet material.\n  - Long, sheer sleeves of matching burgundy chiffon drape elegantly from her shoulders, resting casually along the stone balustrade behind her as she leans forward slightly.\n\n**Setting & Background:**\n- **Foreground/Immediate Surroundings:** She stands leaning against a white marble or stone balustrade. To her right, there's a vibrant bush of blooming roses—predominantly deep crimson and some creamy-white flowers—with lush green foliage.\n- **Background Architecture:** Behind her, partially obscured by trees and hedges, sits a grand building with classical architectural elements including arched windows and balconies, suggesting a European-style villa or estate.\n- **Environment:** The scene is bathed in warm, golden sunlight, indicating late afternoon light casting soft shadows. The background is gently blurred (bokeh effect), which helps draw focus to the subject while still providing context for the setting.\n\n**Image Quality & Composition:**\n- The photograph exhibits exceptional clarity, sharpness, and color saturation.\n- Lighting is flattering, highlighting her facial contours and the texture of her dress.\n- The composition places her centrally, creating a balanced yet dynamic pose.\n- In the bottom center of the image, watermarked text reads “LZ5.net” followed by smaller Chinese characters (“美女人人”), likely identifying the source or creator of the photo.\n\nOverall, it’s a sophisticated and romantic fashion portrait capturing elegance, grace, and natural beauty amidst a luxurious outdoor environment."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 153, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 84, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "1.2.5", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 24}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [160], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name"